{"id":"sponge-fruit","name":{"en":"Sponge Fruit","ja":"スポンジの実"},"desc":{"en":"A fruit with a fluffy, sponge-like texture. It's completely tasteless. It's very light so it's seen floating at the beach all the time.","ja":"ふわふわしたスポンジのような果肉をもつ木 の実。味は無味無臭。とても軽いので、よく 波打ち際でぷかぷか浮いてるのだが、どこか ら流れ着いたのかは、実はよく分かってない。"},"level":8,"locations":[{"id":"inner-islets","name":{"en":"Inner Islets","ja":"内海列島"}},{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}},{"id":"outer-islets","name":{"en":"Outer Islets","ja":"外海諸島群"}}],"categories":[{"id":"spice","name":{"en":"(Spice)","ja":"（香料）"},"icon":"totori-category-spice"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"threads","name":{"en":"(Threads)","ja":"（糸素材）"},"icon":"totori-category-threads"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（食材・野菜）"},"icon":"totori-category-vegetable"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":40}